    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a psychological horror game filled with oppressive atmosphere. In the game, five ordinary people including the protagonist come to an ancient castle on a small island near the far north for vacation, only to find the island completely deserted. They discover strange human-faced megaliths near the castle. Then at night, terrifying events begin to happen as monsters start appearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to control the protagonist Daniel to protect companions, collect clues and items within limited time, while avoiding the pursuit of Victor (an NPC who transforms into a monster) and the curse of the human-faced megaliths. They must uncover the truth about the 1890 expedition and ultimately engage in a final battle against the mutated monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features tight pacing, with playthrough time ranging from 1 to 3 hours depending on player choices. After completing the game, new story branches and hidden endings can be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a video platform content creator or streamer, or want to recommend this game to friends, please contact us for free redemption codes for livestreams or giveaways.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a psychological horror game filled with oppressive atmosphere. In the game, five ordinary people including the protagonist come to an ancient castle on a small island near the far north for vacation, only to find the island completely deserted. They discover strange human-faced megaliths near the castle. Then at night, terrifying events begin to happen as monsters start appearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to control the protagonist Daniel to protect companions, collect clues and items within limited time, while avoiding the pursuit of Victor (an NPC who transforms into a monster) and the curse of the human-faced megaliths. They must uncover the truth about the 1890 expedition and ultimately engage in a final battle against the mutated monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features tight pacing, with playthrough time ranging from 1 to 3 hours depending on player choices. After completing the game, new story branches and hidden endings can be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a video platform content creator or streamer, or want to recommend this game to friends, please contact us for free redemption codes for livestreams or giveaways.</p>",
